c.1\r\n\r\n### Reproduction link\r\n[https://github.com/Tajnymag/vue-route-bleed-poc](https://github.com/Tajnymag/vue-route-bleed-poc)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n1) build the project\r\n2) open in the browser\r\n3) click on the \"Table\" link\r\n4) click on the \"Index\" link\r\n\r\n### What is expected?\r\nAll of the elements of the Table route should be removed from DOM and only elements of route Index should be present.\r\n\r\n### What is actually happening?\r\nExcept &lt;h1&gt;, &lt;table&gt; and &lt;button&gt; are appended to the App's body. The word \"appended\" is important, as the old bleeded components are not removed and so we can get multiple copies of them.\r\n\r\n![How it looks after some time](https://i.imgur.com/sHiK0hM.png)\r\n\r\n---\r\nFor some reason, it works as expected when ran using the vite's dev server. It suddenly starts bugging out when built and served on your own.\r\n\r\n<!-- generated by vue-issues. DO NOT REMOVE -->","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/router/issues/572/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/router/issues/572/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":3954905667,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDM5NTQ5MDU2Njc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/events/3954905667","actor":{"login":"posva","id":664177,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NDE3Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/664177?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/posva","html_url":"https://github.com/posva","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/posva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/posva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/posva/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/posva/starred{/own